<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS11" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Predicting Language Models’ Success at Zero-Shot Probabilistic Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.11 </span>Additional CDF Plots</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS12" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Predicting Language Models’ Success at Zero-Shot Probabilistic Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.12 </span>Prompting Templates</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS13" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Predicting Language Models’ Success at Zero-Shot Probabilistic Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.13 </span>AI Assistants In Research Or Writing</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS14" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Predicting Language Models’ Success at Zero-Shot Probabilistic Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.14 </span>Risks</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS15" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Predicting Language Models’ Success at Zero-Shot Probabilistic Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.15 </span>Hardware Details.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
