</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>
Correlation between AUC scores of failure prediction and predicting the outcome variable for all datasets, for GPT-4o-mini (a) and Llama (b).
</figcaption>
