<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Correlation between aggregate metrics derived from our experiments on the unlabeled datasets and the AUC scores of GPT-4o-mini on each of the datasets, where each point represents one dataset. We plot the best-fit line with its corresponding <math id="S4.F7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> value for each metric. See Appendix <a href="#A1.SS4" title="A.4 Correlation between Metrics and AUC ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Predicting Language Models’ Success at Zero-Shot Probabilistic Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.4</span></a> for the same set of plots made for Llama.</figcaption>
