</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 21: </span>Proxy tasks in the Masking experiment using GPT-4o (a,c) and Mistral-7b-Instruct-v0.1 (b,d), including the original 31 tasks. (a,b) show LOESS fits (with 95% CI) of actual vs. XGBoost-predicted AUCs, trained via grouped 5-fold cross-validation. Each point represents one prediction task. (c,d) show AUC averages after thresholding on predicted AUCs, analogous to Figures <a href="#S4.F9.sf3" title="In Figure 9 ‣ 4.3 Task-Level Results. ‣ 4 Results ‣ Predicting Language Models’ Success at Zero-Shot Probabilistic Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9(c)</span></a> and <a href="#S4.F9.sf4" title="In Figure 9 ‣ 4.3 Task-Level Results. ‣ 4 Results ‣ Predicting Language Models’ Success at Zero-Shot Probabilistic Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9(d)</span></a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
