<div id="A1.SS12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the templates used to generate each of our dataset-level metrics below.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.SS12.tab1" class="ltx_table">
